OL,3,ABadenoch urges PM to overturn ban on
OL,4,Anew licences as gas drilling gets
OL,5,Ago-ahead at Jackdaw
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt was announced earlier that
OL,8,Fextraction from Jackdaw in North Sea
OL,9,Fhad been approved, with the government
OL,10,Fsaying it will help "heat millions of
OL,11,Fhomes" and protect "hundreds of jobs"
OL,13,FEnergy Secretary Miatta Fahnbulleh
OL,14,Ftells the BBC the gas from Jackdaw
OL,15,F"won't lower energy bills this winter"
OL,16,F- our business editor says the new
OL,17,Ffield will contribute less than 3% of
OL,18,Fthe UK's gas needs
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/41
