OL,3,ATrump and Zelensky at loggerheads
OL,4,Adespite new optimism
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe hug that Trump envoy Steve Witkoff
OL,7,Foffered Volodymyr Zelensky before talks
OL,8,Fin Oslo is unlikely to have dispelled
OL,9,Fthe Ukrainian leader's misgivings about
OL,10,Fthe current direction of US policy
OL,11,Ftowards his war-ravaged country.
OL,13,FZelensky posted a video of the moment
OL,14,Fon social media, with the message
OL,15,F"Ukraine is working for peace. I thank
OL,16,Four partners for their support!"
OL,18,FBut given everything that's happened
OL,19,Fthis month, does the Ukrainian leader
OL,20,Fstill regard Donald Trump as a partner?
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/41
