OL,3,AAustralian MP loses both legs after
OL,4,Aalleged car attack, husband says
OL,5,
OL,6,FHelen Haines, the Australian MP who was
OL,7,Fhit by a car in what authorities say
OL,8,Fwas a deliberate attack, has lost both
OL,9,Fher legs, her husband has confirmed.
OL,11,FPhil Haines said the "horrendous
OL,12,Fincident" caused his wife significant
OL,13,Finjuries but "her heart and her mind
OL,14,Fare in good shape". He added that the
OL,15,F"good news in all this is that she's
OL,16,Falive".
OL,18,FThe alleged attacker, 43-year-old
OL,19,FBrendan Nugent, faces multiple charges
OL,20,Fand appeared in court for the first
OL,21,Ftime on Wednesday.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/41
